# Working caches generate-captures.sh warms inside the container (full repos with
# JARs). They are cleaned up by the script; ignored here as belt-and-suspenders so
# a partial run never commits them. Only the lean m2/ | modules2/ POM slices, the
# native.* oracle, tool-version.txt, and gradle.lockfile are committed.
*/.m2repo/
*/.gradlehome/
# Gradle's per-project build cache, written into proj/ when the capture runs
# `gradle -p proj`. Transient; never part of the committed fixture.
**/.gradle/
